<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>HyperShift CI Daily Health — $generated_at</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#f4f6fb;--card:#fff;--ink:#1f2733;--muted:#5c6b82;--line:#e0e6f0;--green:#137333;--greenbg:#e6f4ea;--red:#b3261e;--redbg:#fce8e6;--amber:#8a6d00;--amberbg:#fef7e0;--blue:#1a56db;--bluebg:#e8f0fe;--slate:#334155}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.45 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 20px 60px}
h1{font-size:24px;margin:0 0 4px}
.sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:13.5px}
.meta{margin-top:8px;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
section{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;padding:18px 20px;margin:16px 0;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(20,30,50,.04)}
h2{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 12px}
h2 .count{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:var(--muted)}
h3{font-size:14px;margin:14px 0 6px;color:var(--slate)}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13px}
th,td{text-align:left;padding:8px 10px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:middle}
th{font-size:11.5px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.04em;color:var(--muted);font-weight:600}
tbody tr:hover{background:#f8faff}
code{font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:12px;background:#eef1f7;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px}
.pill{display:inline-block;padding:2px 9px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap}
.pill.green{background:var(--greenbg);color:var(--green)}
.pill.red{background:var(--redbg);color:var(--red)}
.pill.amber{background:var(--amberbg);color:var(--amber)}
.pill.slate{background:#e2e8f0;color:var(--slate)}
.bar{position:relative;height:8px;width:90px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef1f7;overflow:hidden;display:inline-block;vertical-align:middle}
.bar>span{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;border-radius:6px}
.mut{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
.flex{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}
details{margin-top:10px}
summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:13px;color:var(--blue);font-weight:600}
details svg{margin:8px 0}
.callout{border-left:5px solid var(--blue);background:var(--bluebg);padding:12px 15px;border-radius:6px;margin:4px 0}
.callout.red{border-left-color:var(--red);background:var(--redbg)}
.callout.green{border-left-color:var(--green);background:var(--greenbg)}
ul.notes{margin:4px 0 0;padding-left:20px}
ul.notes li{margin:4px 0}
svg{display:block;max-width:100%}
a{color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
footer{text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-top:22px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
<header>
<h1>HyperShift CI Daily Health</h1>
<div class="sub">Supported releases (N-4): payload-blocking &amp; component-readiness periodics, and merge-queue presubmits.</div>
<div class="meta">$meta</div>
</header>
$body
<footer>Deterministic report from the CI Health dashboard + release controller. Pass-rate bars exclude infra-only failures; SLO $slo%. Judgment and Jira bookkeeping are the bot's, after human approval.</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
